#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""autocraft - build and customize AI agent teams for software projects.

One tool-neutral definition of roles, teams, workflows, archetypes and capabilities
(this repo) is exported into the native format of whichever AI tool you use.

    autocraft list [roles|teams|workflows|archetypes|capabilities|tools]
    autocraft recommend "I want an app where students book yoga classes and pay"
    autocraft init [DIR] --tool claude-code,cursor --team web-product --archetype fullstack-app ...
    autocraft sync [DIR]                 regenerate tool files from .autocraft/config.yml
    autocraft add-role|remove-role ID    edit the roster      (then sync happens automatically)
    autocraft add-tool|remove-tool ID    edit the tool list
    autocraft new-role ID                scaffold a custom role in .autocraft/custom/roles/
    autocraft github [DIR] --lang L      add CI, security scanning and GitHub templates
    autocraft doctor [DIR]               check the setup
    autocraft review-map [DIR]           what is in this diff? product vs tests vs generated (no model tokens)

Standard library only (Python 3.8+).
"""
